    "text": "And, men \u00fea leofestan, hit s\u00e6g\u00f0 her on \u00f0isum halgum gewrite \u00fe\u00e6t sunna is sprecende ofer manna\nAc forl\u00e6t me, Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t ic gehyde lyoman mines m\u00e6gnes, \u00fe\u00e6t hi agyten \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u eart ana so\u00f0 God.\n\u00d0a andswerede Drihten and \u00f0us w\u00e6s cwe\u00f0ende \u00fe\u00e6t, ealle gesih\u00f0e mine eagun geseo\u00f0, and ealle\nAc min ge\u00f0yld onbit o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t hige w\u00e6ndan and hrywe don hyra synna, and gif hi nylla\u00f0, ic heom gedeme\nAnd seo yr\u00f0e cegde to Drihtne ofer manna bearnum and \u00f0us w\u00e6s cwe\u00f0ende, Drihten God \u00e6lmihtig,\nSe f\u00e6der arist ofer his sunu and se sunu ofer his f\u00e6der, \u00fe\u00e6t is hyora \u00e6g\u00feer o\u00f0erne oferhoga\u00fe, and se\nSe f\u00e6der astih\u00f0 ofer his sunu reste \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0a besmite\u00f0, and se sunu h\u00e6m\u00f0 wi\u00f0 his f\u00e6der lafe, and syo\nAc forl\u00e6t me, Drihten \u00e6lmihtig, \u00fe\u00e6t ic gebrece m\u00e6gen minra w\u00e6stma \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hige swa to \u00f0e gecyrre.\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s geworden Drihtenes stefen to \u00f0\u00e6re yor\u00f0an, and \u00f0us w\u00e6s cwe\u00f0ende, ne m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man his\nAnd geseo\u00f0 nu, men \u00f0a leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwilc gesc\u00e6ft is Gode under\u00f0yoded, and \u00fe\u00e6t mennisce cyn \u00f0e\nNu \u00f0onne, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Paulus, ic l\u00e6re manna bearn \u00fe\u00e6t hi ne geswican on eallum tidum, d\u00e6ges and\nEac swylce ic geseah, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Paulus, on \u00f0a tid \u00f0e sunne , \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00e6nglas coman to Drihtne\nAnd \u00fea w\u00e6s geworden Drihtenes stefen to Sancte Paule, and \u00f0us cwe\u00f0ende, hwanon coman ge ure\nAnd hi \u00f0a andsweredan Drihtne \u00f0a \u00e6nglas and cw\u00e6dan, we coman fram \u00f0\u00e6m mannum \u00f0e on \u00f0e\nAc middangeardes gelsan hige earme gedydon, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hige anne d\u00e6g on eallum hyran life, hige wel\nAc to hwan, Drihten, scylan we \u00f0enian swa synfullum mannum?\nDrihtnes stefen \u00f0a w\u00e6s geworden to \u00feam \u00e6nglan, \u00f0us cwe\u00f0ende, \u00f0earf is \u00fe\u00e6t ge heom \u00f0enian o\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6t\nOngyta\u00f0 nu, manna bearn, for\u00f0em swa hw\u00e6t swa fram us bi\u00f0 gedon, godes o\u00f0\u00f0e yfeles, eall \u00fe\u00e6t fram\nAnd for\u00f0an bletsia\u00f0 eow and gebidda\u00f0 eow to Drihtne, ge d\u00e6ges ge nihtes.\n\u00dea \u00e6fter \u00f0an, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Paulus, me genam Drihtenes \u00e6ngel and cw\u00e6\u00f0, gefolga me, and ic \u00f0e \u00e6tywe\nAnd se \u00e6ngel hine \u00f0a gel\u00e6dde, Paulum, on nyowelnessa \u00f0\u00e6r hylware w\u00e6ron, and he him \u00f0\u00e6r\nAnd Paulus \u00f0\u00e6r geseah ondryslic weald \u00f0ara m\u00e6naga gasta, \u00f0e manna hyrtan beswica\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t is t\u00e6lnessa\nPaulus \u00f0a ahsode \u00f0ane \u00e6ngel and cw\u00e6\u00f0, wealdend, hw\u00e6t syndan \u00f0as?\nSe \u00e6ngel him andswerede and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Paule, \u00f0is syndon \u00f0a gastas, \u00f0a \u00f0e beo\u00f0 ges\u00e6nde to arleasra\nPaulus \u00f0a eft locode on heannesse, and he \u00f0\u00e6r geseah o\u00f0re \u00e6nglas, \u00f0ara ansyne scinan swa swa sunne,\nAnd Paulus \u00f0a ahsode \u00f0ane \u00e6ngel \u00f0e hine l\u00e6dde, hw\u00e6t \u00f0a w\u00e6ron on swa mycelere f\u00e6gernesse.\nSe \u00e6ngel him andswerede and cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00f0is syndon so\u00f0f\u00e6stnyssa \u00e6nglas, \u00f0a beo\u00f0 ges\u00e6nde to so\u00f0f\u00e6stre\nAnd Paulus \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0\u00e6m \u00e6ngle \u00f0e hine l\u00e6dde, wealdend, ic wolde geseon so\u00f0f\u00e6stra and synfulra\nSe \u00e6ngel him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, loca of heofonum on eor\u00f0an, and Paulus \u00f0a locode, and he geseah alne\nSe \u00e6ngel him andswerede and cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00f0is syndon \u00f0a \u00f0e singia\u00f0 fram \u00e6rnemerigen o\u00f0 \u00e6fen.\nAnd Paulus \u00f0a eft locode, and he geseah ealne middangeard on \u00f0yostrum gesetted, and sume so\u00f0f\u00e6ste\nAnd \u00f0a \u00e6fter \u00f0an \u00f0a, gebyrede hit \u00fe\u00e6t Paulus gehyrde stefna on heofona heanyssum cwe\u00f0ende,\nAnd mid \u00f0i \u00f0e heo w\u00e6s ingangende on heofonum, Paulus gehyrde \u00f0usend \u00e6ngla and heah\u00e6ngla\nAnd hi \u00f0a gel\u00e6ddon to Drihtnes gesih\u00f0e, and Michahel and eall \u00e6ngla werod gefeollan \u00f0a to\nAnd \u00f0a w\u00e6s geworden Drihtenes stefen, cwe\u00f0ende, swa heo me ne geunrotsode on yr\u00f0an, ne ic hire\nAnd Paulus \u00f0a gehyrde \u00e6fter \u00f0an \u00f0usend \u00f0usendo \u00e6ngle lofigendra, and God wuldrigenda, and\nAnd se \u00e6ngel \u00f0e l\u00e6dde Paulum him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, loca of dune, and Paulus \u00f0a locode on yor\u00f0an, and he\nAnd Paulus \u00f0a locode and cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic geseah, on \u00f0\u00e6re tide \u00f0e hire sawul of hire lichaman eode, ealle\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6r \u00e6tsomne coman \u00f0a halgan \u00e6nglas and \u00f0a godan gastas, ac \u00f0a haligan gastas nan geweald on\nSe \u00e6ngel, \u00f0e \u00f0ara sawle hyrde w\u00e6s on worulde, cegde to \u00f0\u00e6re sawle and cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic eam \u00f0in \u00e6ngel, and\nAc se mildhyorta Drihten and se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema us bebead, \u00fe\u00e6t we eow \u00f0enian o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e ge gehwyrfan\nAnd \u00e6fter \u00f0issum, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Paulus, ic gehyrde on heofona heanyssum \u00e6ngla stefna cwe\u00f0ende,\nAnd Paulus gehyrde \u00f0usend \u00f0usenda \u00e6ngla, ealle anre stemne, cygendre and cwy\u00f0endre, wa \u00f0e, \u00f0u\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6re sawle \u00e6ngel cygde \u00f0a, and he cw\u00e6\u00f0, wepa\u00f0 ealle mid me, mine \u00f0a leofan frynd, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0eos\nAnd \u00f0a \u00e6nglas him andsweredan and cw\u00e6dan, ac syo hige anumen of ure mundwiste, for\u00f0an \u00f0e mid\nAnd \u00e6fter \u00f0an, syo sawul w\u00e6s gebroht beforan Gode, se \u00f0e hi gewrohte to his anlicnesse, and hire\nAnd Drihten, se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema, hire to cw\u00e6\u00f0, hw\u00e6r syndan \u00f0ine w\u00e6stmas for eallum \u00f0\u00e6m godum \u00f0e\nIc let scinan mine sunnan ofer \u00f0e, eallswa ofer \u00f0ane so\u00f0f\u00e6stan, and ic gegearwode \u00f0e yor\u00f0an w\u00e6smas,\nAnd for \u00fe\u00e6m, \u00f0u syge nu anumen heonan, and \u00f0u sy geseald on dyofla hand, and hi \u00f0e ges\u00e6ndan on\nAnd eft Paulus gehyorde \u00e6ngla stefna, \u00f0us cwe\u00f0ende, So\u00f0f\u00e6st ear\u00f0u, Drihten, and rihte syndan \u00f0ine\nAnd eft Paulus locode on yor\u00f0an, and he cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic geseah o\u00f0re sawle of lichaman ut gangende, and\nAnd se lyfigenda Drihten hire andswyrede and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eala \u00f0u arleasa sawul, hw\u00e6t gedydest \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u\nSeo sawul him geandswyrede and cw\u00e6\u00f0, ne gesyngode ic n\u00e6fre, Drihten.\nAnd se lyfigenda Drihten \u00f0a gewear\u00f0 swi\u00f0e yrre, for\u00f0an \u00f0e hyo gecw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t hio n\u00e6fre ne syngode,\nAc eower \u00e6lc lih\u00f0 on o\u00f0rum, and \u00f0\u00e6r is synna, and hio hine \u00f0anne gegreta\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s synfullan mannes.",
